      <description>&lt;h1 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Anne Arundel County Transit Routes&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;anne-arundel-county-transit-routes&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#anne-arundel-county-transit-routes&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Public transit in Anne Arundel County centers on the MTA bus system and MARC train. Routes connect the county to Baltimore and DC, plus local circulation within communities.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;MTA Commuter Bus Routes&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;mta-commuter-bus-routes&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#mta-commuter-bus-routes&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The Maryland Transit Administration runs commuter buses from Anne Arundel to Baltimore and Washington DC. These are your main options for car-free commuting.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
